  "description": "Change of use from Use Class C3 (dwelling house) to Use Class C4 (HMO-house in multiple occupation) for 6 persons, including single storey rear/side extension, rear dormer, dormer to rear outrigger, front roof lights, refuse and cycle storage.",
  "development_type": "Other change of use",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development to which this permission relates must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of the decision notice. \r\rReason: To comply with the provisions of S.51 of the Planning & Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.\r",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans:\rPlans\rE00\rP01\rP02\rP03\rP04\rP05\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "The development shall not be occupied until details of the siting, number and design of 6 long stay cycle parking at the rear and 2 short stay cycle parking at the front of the property have been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details before it is occupied.\r\rReason: To ensure the provision of cycle parking in line with the Council's adopted standards.\r",
    "Prior to occupation of the development, the refuse storage facilities shown on drawing number P01 shall be provided in accordance with the approved details and maintained as such thereafter.\r\rReason: In the interests of amenity and the recycling of waste materials in support of the Boroughs waste reduction targets.\r\r",
    "The use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 6 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units. \r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r"
  ],
